\newlabel{fig:bcsetup}{{7}{5}{Supports and computed deformation at $n_H = 16$: clamped left face; pin + roller (3 fixed values); a free beam with a balanced load. For the free beam the rigid motion was removed before drawing. The fourth setting, the cantilever loaded by forces only, is described in Section~\ref {sec:traction}}{figure.caption.10}{}}
